## Large files (Git LFS)

- Binaries matching the LFS patterns in `.gitattributes` are stored in Git LFS. Track new kinds with `git lfs track "<glob>"` and commit `.gitattributes` with them.
- Never run `git lfs migrate import` or `export` without `--no-rewrite` unless the user asks: it rewrites history and needs a force push.
{%- endif %}
